I hear Nina travelled
around Europe for a while


01:20:40.522 --> 01:20:43.762
and eventually got a job
at a fancy restaurant in Rome.


01:20:43.921 --> 01:20:47.882
This year, her parents are going to
visit her for Thanksgiving.


01:20:54.000 --> 01:20:55.648
I'm not saying
what happened last Christmas


01:20:55.800 --> 01:20:57.884
happened solely
because of Nina.


01:20:59.240 --> 01:21:02.688
I'm saying maybe what happened
needed to happen,


01:21:02.840 --> 01:21:05.164
even for me.


01:21:07.720 --> 01:21:09.444
- Ah!
- Whoa! Whoa!


01:21:09.600 --> 01:21:11.487
My dad came into the city
the other day


01:21:11.640 --> 01:21:13.440
to celebrate my new job.


01:21:14.599 --> 01:21:17.120
He told me he offered the house
to my mom but...


01:21:17.280 --> 01:21:18.763
...she didn't want it.


01:21:18.920 --> 01:21:22.640
He thought about selling
but decided to hold onto it


01:21:22.799 --> 01:21:24.282
for when Toby and I
come visit.


01:21:24.439 --> 01:21:27.079
He's still
figuring things out.


01:21:27.239 --> 01:21:30.686
But, luckily, he has
his best friend to help with that.


01:22:51.154 --> 01:22:54.601
# I saw you, I found you


01:22:54.754 --> 01:22:58.081
# I watched you grow


01:22:58.233 --> 01:23:01.081
# Slowly but surely


01:23:01.234 --> 01:23:05.314
# We ebb and we ﬂow


01:23:05.473 --> 01:23:08.801
# I felt a change


01:23:08.952 --> 01:23:12.357
# Deep in my bones


01:23:12.512 --> 01:23:17.237
# Something new


01:23:17.392 --> 01:23:19.433
# Has grown


01:23:25.032 --> 01:23:28.359
# I was inside waiting


01:23:28.512 --> 01:23:31.959
# Eyes open wide


01:23:32.111 --> 01:23:37.796
# I felt the ground beneath me wake


01:23:39.231 --> 01:23:42.636
# I felt a change


01:23:42.791 --> 01:23:46.239
# Deep in my bones


01:23:46.390 --> 01:23:51.955
# Something new


01:23:52.111 --> 01:23:54.194
# Has grown


01:24:07.629 --> 01:24:10.149
# Up in your room


01:24:10.309 --> 01:24:14.674
# Was a great silent storm


01:24:14.829 --> 01:24:16.073
# Clouds have cleared


01:24:16.229 --> 01:24:20.713
# The air was sweet and warm. #

